cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-sdk-rust in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-sdk-rust: a typed Rust client for the pain001 REST API"
abstract: >-
  A blocking, typed Rust client for the REST API of pain001, which
  generates and validates ISO 20022 pain.001 and pain.008 payment files.
  It runs the pain001 suite's shared conformance kit against a live
  server.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.87"
